cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use torch-vulkan in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "torch-vulkan: a Vulkan compute backend for PyTorch"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch backend (device "vk") that runs every operation as a Vulkan compute
  kernel, aimed at scientific workloads: float64, complex numbers, FFTs, dense
  and sparse linear algebra, on any GPU with a Vulkan 1.1 driver.
type: software
authors:
